+    /// A run in a nested cell counts under its release-all or single half,
+    /// the treated pool, its crossed cell and the three marginal halves its
+    /// bits name, and under no other export cell.
+    #[test]
+    fn a_nested_cell_counts_under_exactly_the_export_cells_that_contain_it() {
